{
  "slug": "quick-tofu-lentil-wrap",
  "name": "Tofu and lentil cabbage wrap",
  "description": "Seared firm tofu and cooked lentils with sriracha, rolled into crisp cabbage leaves in fifteen minutes.",
  "iconKey": "wrap",
  "instructions": [
    "Press the tofu dry and cut it into small cubes.",
    "Warm the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat and sear the tofu for 5 minutes, turning once, until the edges are firm.",
    "Stir in the cooked lentils, the sriracha hot sauce, the salt and the black pepper and heat through for 2 minutes.",
    "Separate the cabbage into large leaves and lay them out in overlapping pairs.",
    "Spoon the tofu and lentils down the middle of each pair and roll them up tightly from one long edge."
  ],
